WEBVTT

00:00:02.044 --> 00:00:07.592
Multiple unknowns approaching
border region! Scramble at once!

00:00:07.842 --> 00:00:11.888
I repeat, all units, scramble immediately!

00:00:12.138 --> 00:00:17.393
Multiple unknowns approaching
border region! Scramble at once!

00:00:17.643 --> 00:00:21.772
I repeat, all units, scramble immediately!

00:00:22.023 --> 00:00:23.107
02, all green!

00:00:23.357 --> 00:00:25.985
--01, all green!
--03, all green!

00:00:28.154 --> 00:00:30.948
All Adamas ships are ready to go!

00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:34.410
Adamas Squadron, you are clear for launch!

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:37.955
Roger that. All units, liftoff!

00:00:50.843 --> 00:00:52.428
All units, follow me!

00:00:54.263 --> 00:00:57.975
You are clear to use all available armaments!

00:01:03.481 --> 00:01:05.775
Attention unidentified craft.

00:01:06.025 --> 00:01:12.740
You have five minutes to hand over
Princess Millia, disarm, and surrender.

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:14.158
I repeat...

00:01:14.408 --> 00:01:21.207
You have five minutes to hand over
Princess Millia, disarm, and surrender.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:28.839
<i>Soko ni nani ga aru toshite mo</i>

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:37.515
<i>Mikai no ryouiki e kimi to</i>

00:01:45.773 --> 00:01:53.823
<i>Mijikai yume wo miteta ima</i>

00:01:54.073 --> 00:01:58.452
<i>Are wa kimi no senaka</i>

00:01:58.703 --> 00:02:04.625
<i>Kako? Mirai?</i>

00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:15.386
<i>Furikitte iru meetaa no hari wo mushi shite</i>

00:02:15.636 --> 00:02:18.514
<i>Oikaze to kanjou no muku hou e</i>

00:02:18.764 --> 00:02:24.687
<i>Habataku tabi kizukasareru</i>

00:02:24.937 --> 00:02:30.234
<i>Nido to deaenai sora ga aru koto</i>

00:02:30.484 --> 00:02:35.740
<i>Sore demo tobitatsu nara</i>

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:42.538
<i>Kimi no tsubasa ni naru watashi ga</i>

00:03:01.974 --> 00:03:03.851
Absolute silent running...

00:03:04.101 --> 00:03:06.312
I didn't even pick up wind noise from it!

00:03:06.562 --> 00:03:07.897
Tatiana.

00:03:08.147 --> 00:03:10.149
The Federation and Glacies...

00:03:10.399 --> 00:03:12.943
I guess we better prepare for the worst...

00:03:13.194 --> 00:03:14.945
All ships, prepare for combat!

00:03:15.196 --> 00:03:18.282
No! I'm the one they want!

00:03:18.532 --> 00:03:21.327
I can't drag you into this too!

00:03:21.577 --> 00:03:23.371
Hand me over to them!

00:03:25.873 --> 00:03:29.710
Wh... Why are you laughing?!

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:34.256
Is that how weak your
desire to rebuild Turan is?

00:03:34.507 --> 00:03:35.633
Come again?!

00:03:35.883 --> 00:03:37.343
If you're going to save your kingdom,

00:03:37.593 --> 00:03:40.721
you should at least be prepared
to use us as a stepping stone.

00:03:40.971 --> 00:03:43.057
Reveling in self-sacrifice is nice and all,

00:03:43.307 --> 00:03:46.519
but wouldn't you be betraying
your people by doing so?

00:03:47.812 --> 00:03:51.065
Besides, even if we did hand you over...

00:03:51.315 --> 00:03:54.610
...I somehow doubt they'd
let this ship go just like that.

00:04:00.491 --> 00:04:02.618
All ships, prepare for combat!

00:04:09.667 --> 00:04:11.293
#4 torpedo all set!

00:04:11.544 --> 00:04:13.546
Good! Bring it here!

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:18.968
Shell type, armor-piercing! Distance, 200!

00:04:25.724 --> 00:04:27.476
Move! You're in the way!

00:04:28.644 --> 00:04:30.771
Refuel me! I'm going out too!

00:04:31.021 --> 00:04:33.566
This is no place for amateurs! Stay out of this!

00:04:33.816 --> 00:04:37.778
But we're the ones who led 'em here!

00:04:38.028 --> 00:04:41.157
--Hurry! We're heading up immediately!
--Roger!

00:04:43.284 --> 00:04:46.120
Let us take responsibility...

00:04:47.872 --> 00:04:52.209
Let us pros handle this.

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:53.878
But...!

00:04:54.128 --> 00:04:56.088
It's our fault, you know!

00:04:56.338 --> 00:04:59.008
It's our fault this is happening!

00:05:02.052 --> 00:05:04.346
Time is up.

00:05:04.597 --> 00:05:07.683
So much for bargaining...

00:05:07.933 --> 00:05:09.643
Commence fire!

00:05:09.894 --> 00:05:12.897
--All ships, commence firing!
--All ships, commence firing!

00:05:13.147 --> 00:05:14.607
Fire!

00:05:15.649 --> 00:05:17.860
Enemy fleet has opened fire!

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:21.864
We'll charge through! All ships,
commence firing at once!

00:05:22.114 --> 00:05:24.200
All ships, commence firing!

00:05:25.242 --> 00:05:27.203
All ahead, 2nd combat speed!

00:05:29.038 --> 00:05:31.874
Enemy vessel is approaching while firing.

00:05:32.124 --> 00:05:33.959
Encircle her!

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:37.129
All ships, switch to
Solid Inverted Wedge formation!

00:05:41.258 --> 00:05:42.968
Enemy has taken siege formation!

00:05:43.219 --> 00:05:44.803
We're completely surrounded!

00:05:45.054 --> 00:05:46.222
Tear through!

00:05:46.472 --> 00:05:50.518
Engines to 3rd combat speed!
Open aft lift deck!

00:05:54.522 --> 00:05:56.899
Vanship squadron, take off!

00:06:34.895 --> 00:06:38.274
1st and 2nd Squads!
All ships, train guns on target!

00:06:38.524 --> 00:06:40.901
Roger that! Training guns!

00:06:41.151 --> 00:06:43.153
Target acquired...!

00:06:44.572 --> 00:06:46.824
Wh-What?!

00:07:09.805 --> 00:07:12.850
Forward obstructions have
been destroyed and eliminated.

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:14.935
Course is clear!

00:07:15.185 --> 00:07:17.062
Take us out of their siege net.

00:07:17.313 --> 00:07:19.815
Still locked in combat.

00:07:20.065 --> 00:07:24.069
1st and 2nd Squads appear to
have taken substantial damage.

00:07:26.697 --> 00:07:29.950
All ahead full! Heading 10!

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:32.286
Now exiting smoke screen!

00:07:39.043 --> 00:07:40.794
High-speed climbing turn!

00:07:41.045 --> 00:07:43.631
All hands, brace yourselves!

00:07:47.426 --> 00:07:49.386
Oww!

00:07:52.139 --> 00:07:53.724
Ohm!

00:07:53.974 --> 00:07:57.436
Th-The main enemy unit is directly beneath us!

00:08:05.277 --> 00:08:08.656
Status update. Distance from border, 50.

00:08:08.906 --> 00:08:12.910
Active combat zone
continues to approach border.

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:17.331
Remain on standby until
further orders are given.

00:08:17.581 --> 00:08:19.083
R°gefl

00:08:20.918 --> 00:08:22.711
I'm so...

00:08:22.961 --> 00:08:25.089
<i>I'm so useless...</i>

00:08:31.762 --> 00:08:33.263
Fam...?

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:40.062
Enemy has altered heading to 10 and
is moving toward the Glacies border.

00:08:40.312 --> 00:08:41.271
Don't let them escape.

00:08:41.522 --> 00:08:45.067
Aye-aye, Sir! Have 4th Squad cut them off!

00:08:45.317 --> 00:08:46.985
Do not let them escape!

00:08:48.862 --> 00:08:51.615
Moderate damage to outer
armored compartments #3 and #5!

00:08:51.865 --> 00:08:53.450
Heavy damage to #2 turret!

00:08:53.701 --> 00:08:57.121
Multiple enemy destroyers ahead,
near the border!

00:08:57.371 --> 00:09:00.541
Steady as she goes. All ahead full!

00:09:03.711 --> 00:09:06.338
You can't, Fam! We're in the middle of a battle!

00:09:06.588 --> 00:09:08.048
Retrieve the Vanships!

00:09:08.298 --> 00:09:11.343
Th-That's what I tried to tell her, too...

00:09:11.593 --> 00:09:13.220
The Skyfish hunt!

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:15.180
Skyfish hunt...?

00:09:15.431 --> 00:09:17.599
Yeah! The Skyfish hunt!

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:20.519
I'm gonna fulfill my promise
to you once and for all!

00:09:20.769 --> 00:09:22.604
This is the perfect chance!

00:09:22.855 --> 00:09:25.149
Don't you agree, Captain?!

00:09:26.775 --> 00:09:29.111
We can't retrieve you during battle.

00:09:29.361 --> 00:09:31.238
You'll have to make it back on your own.

00:09:48.672 --> 00:09:51.133
Distance to Glacies border, 40!

00:09:51.383 --> 00:09:54.011
Enemy fleet deploying ahead!

00:09:54.261 --> 00:09:55.721
Torpedoes incoming!

00:09:55.971 --> 00:09:57.097
Ascend immediately!

00:09:57.347 --> 00:10:00.642
No, descend! We'll be the
perfect target if we rear up!

00:10:00.893 --> 00:10:04.188
Down trim, 30! Take us into the clouds!

00:10:08.942 --> 00:10:11.612
Target is descending... into the clouds!

00:10:11.862 --> 00:10:13.697
Enemy has evaded torpedoes!

00:10:13.947 --> 00:10:16.325
--Shall we smoke them out?
--Mm.

00:10:16.575 --> 00:10:19.036
All ships, prepare for bombardment!

00:10:19.286 --> 00:10:20.746
What about Giselle, Fam?!

00:10:20.996 --> 00:10:23.499
--There's no time! I'm sending you out!
--Roger!

00:10:23.749 --> 00:10:26.168
Put on your goggles, Millia!

00:10:26.418 --> 00:10:28.337
Wh-What the...? What's going on?!

00:10:28.587 --> 00:10:29.880
Hang on, Millia!

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:32.424
Huh? Wait! What are--?!

00:10:32.674 --> 00:10:34.259
Here we go!

00:10:36.887 --> 00:10:39.473
Y-You can't be serious!

00:10:39.723 --> 00:10:41.058
Pam's ship has departed.

00:10:41.308 --> 00:10:42.851
Close the flight deck!

00:10:43.101 --> 00:10:44.645
Close flight deck.

00:10:44.895 --> 00:10:46.730
Depth charges above!

00:10:57.449 --> 00:10:59.076
Don't let the target surface unnoticed!

00:10:59.326 --> 00:11:01.620
Seizure of the ship is our top priority.

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:04.790
If not an option, then leave
it as intact as possible!

00:11:08.252 --> 00:11:09.670
Engine output has dropped!

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:11.588
Turret #1 has been taken out!

00:11:11.839 --> 00:11:15.425
Pressure bulkhead destroyed!
Fires breaking out aboard the ship!

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:23.684
Multiple enemy propulsion
acoustics at 3, 6, and <i>9</i> o'clock!

00:11:23.934 --> 00:11:25.686
Our retreat has been cut off!

00:11:32.609 --> 00:11:33.902
There's a cliff directly ahead!

00:11:34.152 --> 00:11:35.654
Captain?!

00:11:37.447 --> 00:11:39.867
Distance to cliff, 4,000!

00:11:40.117 --> 00:11:43.453
So it all boils down to our
difference in experience, huh?

00:11:47.541 --> 00:11:51.795
Bad news, everyone.
Captain Tatiana is laughing.

00:11:52.045 --> 00:11:55.591
She has something important to say now.

00:11:56.633 --> 00:11:58.677
This is Tatiana Wisla.

00:11:58.927 --> 00:12:01.972
The Federation demands we hand over
Princess Millia il Velch Cutrettola Turan,

00:12:02.222 --> 00:12:04.308
who is currently under our protection

00:12:04.558 --> 00:12:09.438
as the wise ruler of the
Turan refugee government.

00:12:09.688 --> 00:12:14.985
They have offered to grant us safe
passage from this airspace as collateral.

00:12:15.235 --> 00:12:17.696
However, it's nothing more
than Federation trickery,

00:12:17.946 --> 00:12:22.993
as it's very clear they also
aim to capture the Silvius.

00:12:23.243 --> 00:12:26.538
The seizure of this ship
would endanger Anatoray.

00:12:27.664 --> 00:12:31.668
Don't fear the enemy's numbers!
Fight with every ounce of your strength!

00:12:31.919 --> 00:12:35.714
We will all return to Anatoray!
Every last one of us!

00:12:35.964 --> 00:12:37.424
That is all!

00:12:38.467 --> 00:12:40.928
3,500 to impact!

00:12:41.178 --> 00:12:44.139
Cecily! Find an area with thin bedrock!

00:12:44.389 --> 00:12:45.849
Aye-aye!

00:12:54.358 --> 00:12:57.778
15 degrees off port bow... Distance, 3,000...

00:12:58.028 --> 00:12:59.571
I've located a weak area in the bedrock!

00:12:59.821 --> 00:13:02.240
Ready forward multi-mount
jet-propelled armor-piercing shells!

00:13:02.491 --> 00:13:04.409
Heavy core, winged type!

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:06.328
Leaving cloud cover!

00:13:11.792 --> 00:13:13.085
Target has surfaced!

00:13:13.335 --> 00:13:17.464
No surrender signal given.
I'll order all ships to open fire!

00:13:17.714 --> 00:13:19.383
What a pity.

00:13:26.098 --> 00:13:28.266
Millia! The throttle!

00:13:29.601 --> 00:13:31.228
L-Like this?

00:13:31.478 --> 00:13:33.897
Yeah! You got it!

00:13:40.696 --> 00:13:43.115
Do you think the Silvius will be all right?

00:13:59.464 --> 00:14:02.467
Stop her! Ram her if you have to!
She mustn't be allowed to self-destruct!

00:14:02.718 --> 00:14:04.219
Aye-aye, Sir!

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:06.763
Federation ship dead-ahead!

00:14:07.014 --> 00:14:08.724
Fifteen seconds to contact!

00:14:08.974 --> 00:14:10.392
Full power to engines!

00:14:10.642 --> 00:14:11.768
Engines to full!

00:14:12.019 --> 00:14:14.229
Use her as a stepping stone to leap over!

00:14:22.237 --> 00:14:25.198
They intend to scuttle her and
leave absolutely nothing behind?!

00:14:25.449 --> 00:14:26.992
Fire!

00:14:37.085 --> 00:14:39.296
What is that?

00:14:41.173 --> 00:14:43.633
H-Hey! Hold on, Fam!

00:14:48.847 --> 00:14:51.349
What is this?! What's happening?!

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:53.727
A mountain range near the border is crumbling!

00:14:53.977 --> 00:14:56.396
4th and 5th Squads have
taken heavy casualties!

00:14:58.648 --> 00:15:00.525
Sir...

00:15:00.776 --> 00:15:05.489
Is this why you're known as the Reaper, Silvius?

00:15:06.531 --> 00:15:09.493
All units, hold position!

00:15:09.743 --> 00:15:12.079
Break formation. Squadron, report in.

00:15:12.329 --> 00:15:13.747
02, all clear here.

00:15:13.997 --> 00:15:15.207
--05.
--07.

00:15:15.457 --> 00:15:18.835
--03.
--04... Picking up activity below.

00:15:21.671 --> 00:15:24.049
A-An unknown!

00:15:24.299 --> 00:15:25.675
It drilled through the mountains?

00:15:25.926 --> 00:15:28.762
Federation fleet has encroached border!

00:15:29.012 --> 00:15:32.891
03 will flag the unknown.
The rest of you, follow me.

00:15:33.141 --> 00:15:35.393
Eliminate the intruders.

00:15:42.484 --> 00:15:44.111
--Glacies!
--Don't fire!

00:15:44.361 --> 00:15:48.198
We can slip through the border while
Glacies and the Federation scuffle!

00:15:48.281 --> 00:15:51.368
All units, fire at will!

00:15:56.248 --> 00:15:58.959
Vanguard fleet is locked in combat
across the Glacies border!

00:15:59.209 --> 00:16:00.293
Guzel!

00:16:00.544 --> 00:16:01.878
Attention, all ships!

00:16:02.129 --> 00:16:05.006
You are to leave Glacies territory immediately!

00:16:06.049 --> 00:16:08.718
Attention, unidentified aircraft.

00:16:08.969 --> 00:16:14.391
You are in violation of Glacies
airspace. Surrender at once.

00:16:14.641 --> 00:16:20.814
I repeat, you are in violation of
Glacies airspace. Surrender at once.

00:16:30.532 --> 00:16:33.910
Engine has taken damage!
Output has dropped to 15%!

00:16:34.161 --> 00:16:35.996
Heavy damage to forward portside armaments!

00:16:36.246 --> 00:16:38.790
Unable to use bow-mounted propulsion shells!

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.625
Output has dropped 25%!

00:16:40.876 --> 00:16:42.377
I can't halt our descent!

00:16:42.627 --> 00:16:44.921
Are the long-barrel guns available?!

00:16:45.172 --> 00:16:47.841
Yes, but only one salvo!

00:16:48.091 --> 00:16:49.634
That's good enough.

00:16:51.469 --> 00:16:55.557
Unknown is withdrawing from airspace.

00:16:55.807 --> 00:16:59.477
03, respond! 03!

00:16:59.728 --> 00:17:01.938
Primula...?

00:17:02.022 --> 00:17:05.233
What are they doing?
Why are they still fighting?!

00:17:05.483 --> 00:17:08.236
Visibility is too poor to maintain
contact with the other ships...

00:17:08.486 --> 00:17:11.072
Did you not learn anything
from my father, Guzel?!

00:17:12.115 --> 00:17:14.451
Launch signal flares ordering
all ships to cease fire!

00:17:14.701 --> 00:17:18.622
Then launch signal flares ordering them
to suspend hostilities with Glacies!

00:17:24.252 --> 00:17:26.755
The battleship Borth will lead the fleet

00:17:27.005 --> 00:17:30.133
while we ensure that the Silvius is sunk.

00:17:30.383 --> 00:17:31.343
Aye-aye, Sir!

00:17:31.593 --> 00:17:36.348
Aniguis, Lacerta, Cochlea. Follow us.
We're going after the Silvius!

00:17:40.101 --> 00:17:44.439
Enough. Order all pilots to retreat.

00:17:44.689 --> 00:17:48.360
--Roger!
--Now let's go find 03, Viola!

00:17:48.610 --> 00:17:50.111
Understood!

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:02.457
The Silvius!

00:18:02.707 --> 00:18:04.251
Whoa, she's all beat up...

00:18:04.501 --> 00:18:08.129
Fam! Look! A Glacies Vanship!

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:10.090
Why is it attached to the Silvius?

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:16.263
I dunno. But if there are pilots inside,
we have to save them somehow!

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:23.019
The engine's running. It's still manned!

00:18:23.270 --> 00:18:24.729
It's going to crash!

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:28.316
Fan'!

00:18:28.566 --> 00:18:31.236
No way! No way! No way!

00:18:31.486 --> 00:18:34.406
But it'll get ripped apart
if we don't do something!

00:18:35.699 --> 00:18:37.742
It could wreak havoc on the Silvius, too!

00:18:37.993 --> 00:18:39.661
Yes, but...!

00:18:44.833 --> 00:18:46.459
Where are we...?

00:18:55.218 --> 00:18:56.761
They're...

00:18:59.139 --> 00:19:01.057
...helping us?

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:11.318
--There it goes!
--Huh?!

00:19:11.568 --> 00:19:13.737
We're amazing!

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:26.207
Target the surface of the
Grand Lake! Prepare to fire!

00:19:27.751 --> 00:19:29.210
Fire!

00:19:31.546 --> 00:19:32.964
Rate of descent has decreased!

00:19:33.214 --> 00:19:34.674
"Hpact!

00:19:44.392 --> 00:19:45.894
Fan'!

00:19:47.103 --> 00:19:48.104
The Anshar?!

00:19:48.355 --> 00:19:52.108
She's chasing the Silvius! Not if <i>we</i> can help it!

00:19:57.614 --> 00:20:00.116
--Millia!
--Right!

00:20:04.704 --> 00:20:06.331
Please...

00:20:07.791 --> 00:20:09.376
Hit it!

00:20:22.097 --> 00:20:25.392
Sudden Claudia depressurization!
We've lost our buoyancy!

00:20:25.642 --> 00:20:26.726
What's happened?!

00:20:26.976 --> 00:20:28.978
The ship can't stay afloat! She's going down!

00:20:29.229 --> 00:20:30.688
That can't be!

00:20:33.191 --> 00:20:34.484
Sir...!

00:20:34.734 --> 00:20:36.778
All hands, abandon ship!

00:20:37.028 --> 00:20:39.155
Abandon the Anshar?!

00:20:39.406 --> 00:20:43.284
We can't afford to lose
such a highly trained crew.

00:20:43.535 --> 00:20:44.828
Yes, Sir.

00:20:45.078 --> 00:20:48.456
--All hands, abandon ship!
--All hands, abandon ship!

00:20:57.340 --> 00:21:00.760
You were saved by Sky Pirates?

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:04.597
No, I think it just seemed that way.

00:21:04.848 --> 00:21:08.017
I see. Let's go.

00:21:08.268 --> 00:21:09.936
Rogen

00:21:14.232 --> 00:21:16.734
All flagship crew members have been retrieved!

00:21:20.864 --> 00:21:23.241
The Anshar is going under!

00:21:41.926 --> 00:21:44.179
--The Silvius!
--She's all right!

00:21:44.429 --> 00:21:46.222
What a relief!

00:21:54.772 --> 00:21:59.027
"We've successfully caught the
Federation's 1st Fleet flagship, the Anshar!"

00:21:59.277 --> 00:22:01.446
--They pulled it off!
--Welcome back!

00:22:01.696 --> 00:22:03.198
Way to go!

00:22:03.448 --> 00:22:04.407
Wow...!

00:22:04.657 --> 00:22:06.701
She managed to take down the Anshar?

00:22:06.951 --> 00:22:08.536
You guys are amazin'!

00:22:08.786 --> 00:22:10.246
Princess Millia!

00:22:10.497 --> 00:22:12.999
I was moved to tears!

00:22:16.294 --> 00:22:18.630
Congratulations, Fam.

00:22:18.880 --> 00:22:21.799
You were amazing too, Princess Millia...

00:22:22.050 --> 00:22:27.305
You... finally managed to pull it off...

00:22:37.065 --> 00:22:41.319
We did it, Gisey! We finally got it to work!

00:22:41.569 --> 00:22:44.072
Did you see us, Teddy?!

00:22:51.746 --> 00:22:54.249
Congratulations, Fam...

00:24:03.610 --> 00:24:05.653
<i>What should I do, Ignace?</i>

00:24:05.903 --> 00:24:09.073
<i>Once two girls start fighting,
there's nothin' a guy can do.</i>

00:24:09.324 --> 00:24:11.826
<i>It's taught me just how powerless I really</i> am...

00:24:12.076 --> 00:24:13.411
--Yeah <i>?</i>
--Yes.

00:24:13.661 --> 00:24:16.372
<i>I mean, I could garnish your
pay for the next two months</i>

00:24:16.623 --> 00:24:19.584
<i>and seize Niccolo's gold pocket
watch to cover what you owe me,</i>

00:24:19.834 --> 00:24:23.630
<i>and it wouldn't help me one bit...</i>

00:24:23.880 --> 00:24:28.551
<i>Be quiet before you make me feel
even worse, you business prodigy!</i>
